This is a fan cafe nickname.

24
00:02:47.293 --> 00:02:50.390
- What are you talking about?
- Exactly. What nonsense?

25
00:02:50.649 --> 00:02:52.503
Now he is an ordinary schoolboy.

26
00:02:52.527 --> 00:02:54.226
It won't work that way.

27
00:02:55.205 --> 00:03:00.260
Yes... My name is Sol. Lim Sol.

28
00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.539
