Who told you about the training?
And about me.

42
00:03:47.153 --> 00:03:52.048
Yes. Let's save the situation. He's only 18.

43
00:03:53.427 --> 00:03:55.401
I love swimming.

44
00:03:55.425 --> 00:03:57.878
- Swimming?
- Yes, exactly.

45
00:03:57.902 --> 00:03:59.596
My dog ​​was a master swimmer.

46
00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.874
Naturally, I like swimming.

47
00:04:01.898 --> 00:04:05.830
I was looking for a training video,
and, naturally, I found out about you.

48
00:04:05.854 --> 00:04:09.107
Naturally, I decided to support.

49
00:04:09.131 --> 00:04:14.581
I saw you swimming
I remembered my dog and cried.

50
00:04:14.605 --> 00:04:16.539
Naturally, I said that I love you.

51
00:04:16.563 --> 00:04:18.342
Not natural.

52
00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:19.940
