Nickname. Nickname, nickname, nickname...

57
00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:42.793
- Otter!
- Otter?

58
00:04:42.817 --> 00:04:45.151
He swims better than any other otter!

59
00:04:45.175 --> 00:04:48.152
