Every time I open my mouth
I'm talking nonsense.

72
00:05:36.244 --> 00:05:39.900
Why did I take it? That's right, it's going to rain.

73
00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.218
What kind of person am I!

74
00:05:45.634 --> 00:05:46.733
Here?

75
00:05:48.671 --> 00:05:51.449
I didn’t even have time to enjoy it yesterday.

76
00:05:53.307 --> 00:05:57.279
Can you imagine, and then suddenly he
