91
00:06:35.904 --> 00:06:38.801
Hyun Joo. Hyun Joo, Hyun Joo! Hyun Joo!

92
00:06:39.141 --> 00:06:41.235
I missed you so much, Hyun Joo!

93
00:06:41.259 --> 00:06:44.675
Where have you been? I left my bag
