I don't remember...

97
00:06:56.044 --> 00:06:59.816
This idiot said something
and you decided to take a walk?

98
00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.259
This idiot?

99
00:07:02.597 --> 00:07:04.136
Hello.

100
00:07:04.755 --> 00:07:08.292
God. God, teacher! My God!

101
00:07:11.908 --> 00:07:16.360
Mrs. Kwon, you've been here for a hundred years
