- Stop filming this mess.

103
00:07:18.661 --> 00:07:21.155
Buy an apartment in Pangyo.

104
00:07:21.179 --> 00:07:23.592
With the new station things will go uphill.

105
00:07:23.616 --> 00:07:27.033
Yes, now. In Pangyo.
In the middle of emptiness and fields?

106
00:07:27.612 --> 00:07:29.111
