This is Geum's video. Return the tape.

112
00:07:45.714 --> 00:07:47.888
No, no, I didn't take anything.

113
00:07:47.912 --> 00:07:53.323
How so? I have it written down that they took it.
"Basic instinct", right?

114
00:07:53.347 --> 00:07:56.484
Tell me more...
What is "Basic Instinct"?

115
00:07:56.583 --> 00:08:01.559
And who takes cassettes now?
there is a TV!

116
00:08:01.938 --> 00:08:03.037
What?

117
