138
00:09:04.915 --> 00:09:07.888
Mom, mom. You don't understand at all.
Who knows?

139
00:09:07.912 --> 00:09:10.126
I will walk on the red carpet...

140
00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.042
He will walk, get out of here!
Go, go, go!

141
00:09:14.066 --> 00:09:16.000
No, what if I run away from home?

142
00:09:16.024 --> 00:09:17.598
