Damn. Are you crazy, you bastard?

186
00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.757
How are you talking? Rubbish?

187
00:12:42.977 --> 00:12:45.035
I'm your aunt, brat.

188
00:12:45.654 --> 00:12:48.707
You come to school to smoke
and fight?

189
00:12:48.731 --> 00:12:50.226
There's a gym nearby.

190
00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.063
Do you know how harmful smoke is to swimmers?

191
00:12:53.087 --> 00:12:55.824
You made me angry, I'll confiscate it! Go.

192
00:12:56.084 --> 00:12:58.018
- Go, I say.
- Yes.

193
00:12:58.042 --> 00:13:00.140
Live up, come on.

194
00:13:00.599 --> 00:13:02.737
Aunt, it's time to run.

195
00:13:04.675 --> 00:13:06.174
Follow them!

196
