209
00:14:26.793 --> 00:14:27.812
KIM TAE SON

210
00:14:28.991 --> 00:14:30.805
Exactly, Kim Tae Sun!

211
00:14:30.829 --> 00:14:36.404
What is it? Am I still dreaming?
How much time has passed since then?

212
00:14:37.063 --> 00:14:40.639
- But yesterday you...
- Last year I ran after you.

213
00:14:41.299 --> 00:14:45.031
But then you were cool
not as shabby as it is now.

214
00:14:45.055 --> 00:14:49.786
That's for sure. Who did I talk to yesterday?
Maybe with a double?

215
00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:56.224
Come on. Love went to my head.
I didn't even notice what a bully you are.

216
00:14:57.363 --> 00:14:59.501
You smoke cigarettes. Asshole.

217
00:15:00.519 --> 00:15:03.213
Come to your senses already.
Tobacco is harmful to health...

218
00:15:03.237 --> 00:15:04.376
Whatever you say, aunt.

219
00:15:04.715 --> 00:15:06.693
Here you go.

220
