- Caught red-handed!

222
00:15:19.221 --> 00:15:20.799
You're skipping classes...

223
00:15:20.979 --> 00:15:22.078
What is this?

224
00:15:22.178 --> 00:15:23.876
- Did you smoke?
- I?

225
00:15:26.254 --> 00:15:28.592
No, no, these are not mine. This...

226
00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:32.108
Here... What a bastard!

227
00:15:34.326 --> 00:15:37.263
I just made a remark to smokers.

228
00:15:37.363 --> 00:15:39.377
Our athletes need healthy lungs!

229
00:15:39.401 --> 00:15:42.533
I bravely spoke out against cigarettes.

230
00:15:42.557 --> 00:15:44.016
This is not fair, Teacher Song!

231
00:15:44.116 --> 00:15:49.451
So you went to the guys for a smoke break,
