232
00:15:51.229 --> 00:15:53.327
Who would even believe this?

233
00:15:53.546 --> 00:15:55.045
Who will believe?

234
00:15:55.584 --> 00:15:59.361
I wasn't punished as a child
punished at 30.

235
00:16:01.578 --> 00:16:04.432
It's coming. It's coming. It's coming.

236
00:16:04.456 --> 00:16:05.954
Straighten up!

237
00:16:10.769 --> 00:16:13.986
Go faster. Come on in!

238
00:16:15.125 --> 00:16:16.579
Cuckoo!

239
00:16:16.603 --> 00:16:18.861
Do you think this is a joke?

240
00:16:19.001 --> 00:16:21.579
Stay here until the bell rings.

241
00:16:21.758 --> 00:16:25.734
Everything is visible on the cameras,
so no tricks! Understood?

242
00:16:36.623 --> 00:16:38.042
You know...

243
00:16:40.539 --> 00:16:42.318
Vydrick would be upset.

244
00:16:42.458 --> 00:16:43.557
