245
00:16:44.296 --> 00:16:45.914
The owner is dying.

246
00:16:46.334 --> 00:16:47.433
Give it up.

247
00:16:48.811 --> 00:16:53.387
No no! I have never smoked a cigarette in my life.

248
00:16:53.447 --> 00:16:56.344
I can drink when things get hard.

249
00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.058
Sun Jae, I don't smoke.

250
00:17:03.397 --> 00:17:06.414
- I am for a healthy lifestyle, honestly!
- By the way.

251
