The cameras aren't real, go ahead.

252
00:17:14.426 --> 00:17:16.683
Wait, I'll explain everything!

253
00:17:18.062 --> 00:17:19.600
Song Jae!

254
00:17:20.739 --> 00:17:25.395
CIGARETTES AWAY

255
