I told you to run away
What is my fault?

256
00:17:36.004 --> 00:17:37.698
Are you rubbing salt in the wound?

257
00:17:37.722 --> 00:17:39.057
Will you give me the lighter?

258
00:17:39.081 --> 00:17:42.014
I threw it away! Unscrupulous.

259
00:17:42.038 --> 00:17:45.011
I saved you from hooligans
are you running away alone?

260
00:17:45.035 --> 00:17:47.169
Wow! Saved me?

261
00:17:47.193 --> 00:17:48.292
Yes!

262
00:17:48.551 --> 00:17:51.129
It was I who pulled you out of there before the fight.

263
00:17:51.309 --> 00:17:52.528
That's it, I understand.

264
00:17:53.786 --> 00:17:55.560
