But I'm a swimmer.

536
00:37:02.717 --> 00:37:05.690
- I'm performing tomorrow.
- Is a performance more important than your life?

537
00:37:05.714 --> 00:37:11.169
If you don't want to cross the Samdocheon Bridge,
don't go into the water for three days!

538
00:37:12.268 --> 00:37:13.886
I'll remember.

539
00:37:13.986 --> 00:37:16.484
Will you remember? Do you remember exactly?

540
00:37:17.183 --> 00:37:19.361
I won't even take a bath. Will it work?

541
00:37:19.780 --> 00:37:21.159
Thank you.

542
00:37:22.537 --> 00:37:24.156
I didn't believe it.

543
00:37:25.415 --> 00:37:27.433
Stay where you are, grandson!

544
00:37:32.008 --> 00:37:35.105
Am I 13 again?

545
00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:43.377
You have a scar on your left foot.

546
00:37:44.356 --> 00:37:46.613
- You see?
- One more...

547
00:37:47.433 --> 00:37:48.931
right there.

548
00:37:58.102 --> 00:37:59.201
No.

549
00:38:03.656 --> 00:38:07.433
You believe in evil eyes.
Please believe me.

550
00:38:22.078 --> 00:38:23.612
Laundered money?

551
00:38:23.636 --> 00:38:26.254
And you got into a fight somewhere again.

552
00:38:28.671 --> 00:38:31.569
Okay, now give me back the bill.

553
00:38:32.827 --> 00:38:33.926
Return?

554
00:38:34.386 --> 00:38:35.720
Will you tell my fortune?

555
00:38:35.744 --> 00:38:36.843
For love.

556
00:38:39.540 --> 00:38:42.078
You've been well decorated.

557
00:38:42.218 --> 00:38:43.716
But you like it.

558
00:38:44.815 --> 00:38:46.394
Have you read the letter?

559
00:38:48.571 --> 00:38:50.590
There's not a star in the sky today -

560
00:38:51.648 --> 00:38:52.947
they are all in my eyes.

561
00:38:54.006 --> 00:38:56.184
- I'm so bright!
- Enough already!

562
00:38:56.484 --> 00:38:58.582
I read...

563
00:39:03.916 --> 00:39:07.608
He got into a fight with the guys
from another school.

564
00:39:07.632 --> 00:39:10.530
What saved him from expulsion was
that he left on his own.

565
00:39:12.428 --> 00:39:13.886
Sit here.

566
00:39:19.301 --> 00:39:21.119
Okay, give me your hand.

567
00:39:28.571 --> 00:39:29.790
Carefully.

568
00:39:30.450 --> 00:39:31.864
I have gentle hands.

569
00:39:31.888 --> 00:39:36.104
The way he smiles with his eyes...
Lousy heartthrob.

570
00:39:36.404 --> 00:39:39.221
It's understandable why the girls go crazy.

571
00:39:42.158 --> 00:39:44.651
Why do you get into fights?

572
00:39:44.675 --> 00:39:46.130
You will be expelled.

573
00:39:46.154 --> 00:39:49.966
I need to finish school
otherwise you will regret it later.

574
00:39:49.990 --> 00:39:51.169
What are you doing, mom?

575
00:39:51.508 --> 00:39:52.727
You grumble.

576
00:39:52.867 --> 00:39:57.682
So here it is. It upsets even me.
How do parents feel?

577
00:39:59.221 --> 00:40:00.520
Spit.

578
00:40:02.777 --> 00:40:04.835
I recently realized this.

579
00:40:05.934 --> 00:40:07.792
You can't do that.

580
00:40:08.492 --> 00:40:11.109
When your child is unwell...

581
00:40:17.682 --> 00:40:20.260
It’s like all your fingers are being broken.

582
00:40:21.119 --> 00:40:23.656
A child's cry is worse than thunder.

583
00:40:24.635 --> 00:40:26.174
That's what mom said.

584
00:40:29.670 --> 00:40:35.565
So don't upset your parents.
Don't get sick or hurt yourself.

585
00:40:36.064 --> 00:40:37.163
Fine?

586
00:40:39.461 --> 00:40:42.238
Not all parents are the same.

587
00:40:43.417 --> 00:40:45.275
It's true...

588
00:40:46.414 --> 00:40:49.551
You'll understand everything when you get older.

589
00:40:52.647 --> 00:40:54.346
Well, we're done.

590
00:40:54.685 --> 00:40:55.824
Give me the money.

591
00:41:00.040 --> 00:41:01.139
Here you go.

592
00:41:16.783 --> 00:41:19.321
My favorite banknote got dirty...

593
00:41:21.459 --> 00:41:23.676
Sorry! I'll change it.

594
00:41:25.694 --> 00:41:28.707
It's good that you were beaten today.

595
00:41:28.731 --> 00:41:29.830
No need!

596
00:41:31.489 --> 00:41:32.987
I'll change it!

597
00:41:34.366 --> 00:41:35.704
Wait...

598
00:41:37.003 --> 00:41:38.182
I'll change it!

599
00:41:40.959 --> 00:41:43.213
Here. With interest.

600
00:41:43.237 --> 00:41:45.131
Five times more. Is it coming?

601
00:41:45.155 --> 00:41:48.611
No need, go already! He will change...

602
00:41:50.350 --> 00:41:51.449
What?

603
00:41:56.783 --> 00:41:57.882
Grandmother!

604
00:41:59.940 --> 00:42:03.796
So we met you again,
grandson...

605
00:42:05.495 --> 00:42:06.669
Grandma?

606
00:42:06.693 --> 00:42:08.472
Go crazy.

607
00:42:10.609 --> 00:42:11.828
Ryu Sung Jae?

608
00:42:12.248 --> 00:42:14.386
In Hyuk's friend, swimmer.

609
00:42:14.446 --> 00:42:15.585
Who are you?

610
00:42:15.844 --> 00:42:16.983
Kim Tae Sun.

611
00:42:17.403 --> 00:42:21.698
She likes Tae-sung, she secretly tells him
leaves chocolates.

612
00:42:26.314 --> 00:42:28.368
The main thing is to be careful of water.

613
00:42:28.392 --> 00:42:30.565
It's time for the old lady to go...

614
00:42:30.589 --> 00:42:31.688
What is this?

615
00:42:32.907 --> 00:42:34.965
What did you do?

616
00:42:35.744 --> 00:42:38.242
Grandma, you were caught.

617
00:42:38.422 --> 00:42:40.200
What to do?

618
00:42:43.057 --> 00:42:44.156
Are you having fun?

619
00:42:44.775 --> 00:42:45.874
Funny?

620
00:42:47.173 --> 00:42:48.871
I'm not having fun...

621
00:42:51.089 --> 00:42:53.343
Sun Jae, listen to me!

622
00:42:53.367 --> 00:42:56.300
A ghost actually came to me!

623
00:42:56.324 --> 00:42:58.941
Sun Jae, just don't go into the water!
I'm telling the truth!

624
00:43:04.715 --> 00:43:05.814
What?

625
00:43:06.873 --> 00:43:08.372
RYU KEUN TOK

626
00:43:09.830 --> 00:43:11.608
Does he live here?

627
00:43:11.788 --> 00:43:12.887
Granny.

628
00:43:13.267 --> 00:43:14.446
Ghost?

629
00:43:18.861 --> 00:43:20.160
Mother!

630
00:43:21.538 --> 00:43:23.357
- Mom, mom, mom!
- Don't scare me!

631
00:43:23.417 --> 00:43:25.630
How long ago has Mr. Pe moved from here?

632
00:43:25.654 --> 00:43:27.588
What kind of view are we at the circus?

633
00:43:27.612 --> 00:43:30.785
He bought himself this spring
new house and moved.

634
00:43:30.809 --> 00:43:33.347
- I didn’t know?
- No, I didn’t know.

635
00:43:34.086 --> 00:43:36.464
How did I even come to my senses?

636
00:43:44.116 --> 00:43:50.050
One, two, three, four, five,

637
00:43:50.350 --> 00:43:56.404
six, seven, eight,

638
00:43:56.623 --> 00:44:03.437
nine, ten, eleven.

639
00:44:03.497 --> 00:44:05.435
Just don't get into the water.

640
00:44:19.441 --> 00:44:21.658
He won't believe in anything anymore.

641
00:44:21.718 --> 00:44:22.937
What should I do?

642
00:44:36.064 --> 00:44:38.082
Where is he going in the middle of the night?

643
00:44:57.283 --> 00:44:59.261
Recover first

644
00:44:59.361 --> 00:45:01.658
otherwise you'll walk across the bridge!

645
00:45:01.958 --> 00:45:04.975
Do you think your body is in good condition?

646
00:45:05.075 --> 00:45:06.693
But this is not true.

647
00:45:08.751 --> 00:45:10.166
Don't overwork yourself.

648
00:45:10.190 --> 00:45:14.526
If you hurt your shoulder,
you can't come back anymore.

649
00:45:24.456 --> 00:45:29.271
I'm proud of you, son!
Of course I knew it!

650
00:46:00.979 --> 00:46:02.198
Beware!

651
00:46:02.418 --> 00:46:06.070
There's a spirit squeezing my neck
innocent drowned woman...

652
00:46:06.094 --> 00:46:09.986
A ghost actually came to me!
Sun Jae, just don't go into the water!

653
00:46:10.010 --> 00:46:11.748
I'm telling the truth!

654
00:46:32.907 --> 00:46:35.401
This idiot believes
like yesterday's swimming trunks

655
00:46:35.425 --> 00:46:37.283
will help him win.

656
00:46:37.622 --> 00:46:40.635
That's why he puts them on in advance.

657
00:46:40.659 --> 00:46:42.198
So what should we do?

658
00:46:47.093 --> 00:46:48.987
The loss will definitely scare him.

659
00:46:49.011 --> 00:46:50.865
What if we get caught?

660
00:46:50.889 --> 00:46:54.266
If you don't talk, they won't catch you.
Quiet.

661
00:47:02.198 --> 00:47:04.176
Do you want to cut yourself?

662
00:47:04.436 --> 00:47:05.575
Let go!

663
00:47:06.633 --> 00:47:08.252
Who are you? Let me go!

664
00:47:08.551 --> 00:47:11.529
Should I tell the whole team?
Or tell the police?

665
00:47:11.908 --> 00:47:16.200
- Leave it and go away.
- Damn it... Who are you?

666
00:47:16.224 --> 00:47:19.241
What's happened? Who's there?

667
00:47:47.872 --> 00:47:49.371
It's coming!

668
00:47:51.149 --> 00:47:52.807
Where is the light?

669
00:48:05.934 --> 00:48:07.193
My legs are numb.

670
00:48:10.450 --> 00:48:11.549
What?

671
00:48:27.952 --> 00:48:29.051
Who's there?

672
00:48:58.761 --> 00:49:00.619
Was it you?

673
00:49:05.475 --> 00:49:07.413
Now you're stealing swimming trunks?

674
00:49:07.672 --> 00:49:10.010
- I didn’t want to steal them...
- Who?

675
00:49:10.190 --> 00:49:12.044
Who do you blame?

676
00:49:12.068 --> 00:49:13.527
Ghost?

677
00:49:14.346 --> 00:49:15.760
Why are you doing this to me?

678
00:49:15.784 --> 00:49:17.563
I'm worried.

679
00:49:18.342 --> 00:49:20.639
I don't know how to explain this...

680
00:49:21.658 --> 00:49:24.356
Nightmare. I had a nightmare.

681
00:49:24.655 --> 00:49:27.349
I dreamed that you were hurt
at the competition.

682
00:49:27.373 --> 00:49:29.147
It was like reality.

683
00:49:29.171 --> 00:49:32.503
And I was very worried
that the nightmare will really come true.

684
00:49:32.527 --> 00:49:33.946
Why were you worried?

685
00:49:35.964 --> 00:49:38.022
- I want to protect you.
- For what?

686
00:49:38.561 --> 00:49:40.060
Why protect me?

687
00:49:40.120 --> 00:49:44.056
- Will I die?
- Yes, you will die! You will die!

688
00:49:44.555 --> 00:49:46.973
And only I know this,

689
00:49:47.113 --> 00:49:48.971
but I can’t tell you.

690
00:49:49.710 --> 00:49:52.008
But I want to protect you.

691
00:49:52.148 --> 00:49:54.645
Do everything to keep you alive.

692
00:49:57.782 --> 00:49:59.441
Why are you silent?

693
00:50:01.419 --> 00:50:03.876
You're acting very strange.

694
00:50:04.016 --> 00:50:05.115
Don't you think so?

695
00:50:05.255 --> 00:50:08.068
The stranger introduces herself as a fan.

696
00:50:08.092 --> 00:50:10.390
Then he dissuades me from competing.

697
00:50:11.009 --> 00:50:12.388
Because of a nightmare?

698
00:50:12.727 --> 00:50:14.106
Who are you?

699
00:50:14.565 --> 00:50:16.623
Why should I listen to you?

700
00:50:20.120 --> 00:50:21.818
Lord...

701
00:50:39.940 --> 00:50:42.478
Son! I...

702
00:50:46.014 --> 00:50:48.711
He has to get up early, where did he go?

703
00:50:49.890 --> 00:50:51.668
This child...

704
00:50:51.848 --> 00:50:53.702
Food tastes good when it's hot.

705
00:50:53.726 --> 00:50:56.180
OK. He will eat when he is hungry.

706
00:50:56.204 --> 00:50:57.742
I'll leave it.

707
00:51:00.519 --> 00:51:01.618
What's there?

708
00:51:06.513 --> 00:51:07.732
What is this?

709
00:51:11.788 --> 00:51:12.887
Secret?

710
00:51:20.699 --> 00:51:22.078
Let's see...

711
00:51:26.254 --> 00:51:27.672
"BASIC INSTINCT"

712
00:51:36.883 --> 00:51:39.101
- Hello?
- Have you been to the pool?

713
00:51:39.520 --> 00:51:41.179
-Have you seen Hyun Goo?
- What?

714
00:51:41.598 --> 00:51:45.810
He said he was coming to punch you.
So you guys ended up fighting?

715
00:51:45.834 --> 00:51:47.049
Did he come?

716
00:51:47.073 --> 00:51:49.930
Can you imagine!
I also wanted to steal your swimming trunks.

717
00:51:50.390 --> 00:51:51.768
Are they there?

718
00:51:52.148 --> 00:51:53.602
What a freak.

719
00:51:53.626 --> 00:51:55.525
You should shake him up.

720
00:51:57.263 --> 00:51:58.362
Hello?

721
00:51:59.261 --> 00:52:00.480
Are you there?

722
00:52:18.681 --> 00:52:20.340
Why are you silent?

723
00:52:20.959 --> 00:52:23.173
You're acting very strange.
Don't you think so?

724
00:52:23.197 --> 00:52:25.495
I know this is not normal.

725
00:52:28.232 --> 00:52:31.089
But I don’t understand what I should do.

726
00:52:47.892 --> 00:52:50.629
One, two...

727
00:52:52.168 --> 00:52:53.267
three...

728
00:52:54.406 --> 00:52:55.505
four...

729
00:52:56.124 --> 00:52:57.223
five...

730
00:53:43.117 --> 00:53:45.055
Salt! Lim Sol!

731
00:53:59.141 --> 00:54:00.240
Are you crazy?

732
00:54:00.659 --> 00:54:01.998
The car is moving!

733
00:54:33.946 --> 00:54:35.924
34-1.

734
00:54:37.862 --> 00:54:39.361
Wrong house.

735
00:54:44.056 --> 00:54:45.674
Uncle!

736
00:55:18.621 --> 00:55:19.720
Is this a package?

737
00:55:20.579 --> 00:55:21.678
My.

738
00:55:23.536 --> 00:55:24.915
Take an umbrella.

739
00:55:25.614 --> 00:55:28.312
- No...
- Take it.

740
00:55:29.850 --> 00:55:34.142
When you can, just put it down
to the cart at that store.

741
00:55:34.166 --> 00:55:36.144
I apologize in advance.

742
00:55:36.284 --> 00:55:39.740
The next package will be heavy.
Lots of books...

743
00:55:41.878 --> 00:55:42.977
Here.

744
00:55:43.037 --> 00:55:45.415
Help yourself. Goodbye!

745
00:57:14.026 --> 00:57:16.803
- Good afternoon.
- Hello.

746
00:57:30.569 --> 00:57:32.827
First name, last name.

747
00:57:34.486 --> 00:57:36.863
Kyn Tok. Ryu Geun Tok.

748
00:57:42.358 --> 00:57:44.136
"BASIC INSTINCT"

749
00:57:51.948 --> 00:57:53.567
Song Jae!

750
00:57:55.385 --> 00:57:57.323
What? What's happened?

751
00:57:58.262 --> 00:57:59.361
Am I dreaming?

752
00:58:02.617 --> 00:58:04.436
Let's be friends!

753
00:58:07.453 --> 00:58:10.070
Son! How are you doing?
REJECTED

754
00:58:12.687 --> 00:58:14.466
Dad, knock!

755
00:58:45.015 --> 00:58:47.593
We are just moving away from each other.

756
00:58:48.132 --> 00:58:50.350
He declined the request.

757
00:58:52.567 --> 00:58:55.624
Is this a sign that it's time for me to stop?

758
00:59:51.508 --> 00:59:54.645
ENTRY PROHIBITED

759
01:00:23.477 --> 01:00:26.574
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

760
01:00:26.673 --> 01:00:31.484
I'll speak. I will perform and win.
I'll get the gold and confess to her.

761
01:00:31.508 --> 01:00:36.839
Love is a difficult game.
We have to choose the moment.

762
01:00:36.863 --> 01:00:38.681
- Moment.
- You tell me...

763
01:00:39.700 --> 01:00:43.672
Do you like Kim Tae Sun as a bass player?
Or a guy?

764
01:00:43.696 --> 01:00:46.154
Let's meet. You like me.

765
01:00:46.454 --> 01:00:49.187
Where did Sung Jae go? He doesn't answer.

766
01:00:49.211 --> 01:00:51.229
- I'm quitting swimming.
- Puppy.

767
01:00:54.166 --> 01:00:56.184
- Stopped it.
- You tell me...

768
01:00:56.603 --> 01:00:58.821
I like you.

769
01:00:59.680 --> 01:01:02.533
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

770
01:01:02.557 --> 01:01:05.015
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

